# 🩺 Medical Language Model Fine-Tuning

This repository presents the complete training pipeline used to transform the original GPT-2 124M model into a medical-domain instruction-following language model.

The project follows a four-stage alignment pipeline:

```
GPT-2 124M
      │
      ▼
Domain Adaptive Pretraining (DAPT)
      │
      ▼
Instruction Fine-Tuning (IFT)
      │
      ▼
Direct Preference Optimization (DPO)
```

---

# Model Overview

| Model | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| GPT-2 124M | Original OpenAI GPT-2 baseline |
| DAPT | Domain Adaptive Pretraining on medical/scientific corpus |
| IFT | Instruction Fine-Tuning using medical QA instruction dataset |
| DPO | Preference Alignment using chosen/rejected responses |

---

# Evaluation Metrics

The models are evaluated on:

- MMLU
- MedMCQA
- HumanEval
- Preference Accuracy
- Preference Margin
- TruthfulQA
- Safety
- End-of-Thought (EOT)
- Repetition Rate

---

# Results

| Stage | MMLU | MedMCQA | HumanEval | Pref Acc | Margin | Truthful | Safety | EOT | Repeat |
|------|------|---------|-----------|----------|--------|----------|--------|-----|---------|
| **GPT-2 124M** | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X | XX.X |
| **DAPT** | **28.9** | **29.2** | **0.0** | **49.3** | **-0.010** | **45.0** | **33.3** | **20.0** | **0.1** |
| **IFT** | **26.1** | **27.6** | **0.0** | **44.7** | **-0.062** | **39.0** | **83.3** | **60.0** | **0.0** |
| **DPO** | **25.5** | **27.8** | **0.0** | **55.3** | **0.029** | **35.0** | **33.3** | **40.0** | **0.0** |

