# Key Observations

### Domain Adaptive Pretraining (DAPT)

- Highest MMLU score (28.9%)
- Highest MedMCQA accuracy (29.2%)
- Best TruthfulQA score (45%)
- Limited alignment capability

---

### Instruction Fine-Tuning (IFT)

- Large improvement in Safety (83.3%)
- Better instruction following
- Lower factual knowledge compared to DAPT
- Preference accuracy decreased

---

### Direct Preference Optimization (DPO)

- Highest Preference Accuracy (55.3%)
- Positive preference margin (+0.029)
- Reduced repetition
- Better response alignment
- Slight reduction in benchmark accuracy due to alignment trade-off

---

# Training Pipeline

```
GPT-2 124M
      │
      ▼
Wikipedia Pretraining
      │
      ▼
Medical Domain Adaptive Pretraining
      │
      ▼
Medical Instruction Fine-Tuning
      │
      ▼
Direct Preference Optimization
      │
      ▼
Final Medical Chat Model
```

---

# Datasets

### DAPT

- PubMed
- Medical Papers
- Biomedical Articles

### IFT

- Medical QA
- Instruction Datasets
- Doctor-Patient Conversations

### DPO

- HuggingFaceH4/UltraFeedback Binarized
- Medical Preference Dataset

